# Web Sign-In Rule

**Rule:** On the website and app, users sign in with the same email/password credentials. Supabase Auth is shared, so one account works on both platforms.

## Implementation

- **Web and app**: Both show the standard Login screen with email/password form.
- **Settings → Link website** (native only): Opens https://www.nautical-ops.com in the user's external browser so they can sign in there with the same credentials.

## Flow

1. User creates account on app or web
2. User signs in with email/password on either platform
3. Same session and profile data across app and web
